From c4267de07c46871e254a6a5c0bd10dca7000cf54 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wojtek Denejko <wojciech.denejko@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 17:22:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] seq4096: M=4096 / R=32768 exact keys for batch-1 seq-4096
 Qwen training

38 keys: every ordinary M=2048 key gets M=4096 and every top-8 grouped R=16384 key
gets R=32768, each on its twin kernel spec, except paired-backward Q3_K at R=32768,
which failed the external oracle on spec 0 (NRMSE 0.38) and uses spec 1. The oracle
copy of the AITER GMM tables gets the 32768-row Qwen keys. Inventory tests: 186 routes.
dashi-local branch (aviai ADR-001 retrain).
---
